# weJobSearch environment template (SDD Section 5).
# No keys are needed today: the six default job-board adapters (LinkedIn,
# hiring.cafe, Wellfound, Welcome to the Jungle, Built In, FlexJobs) are free
# scrapes and require NO API keys (SDD Requirement 8). The only supported
# environment override is the data-root relocation key documented in
# src/utils/canonicalDataRoot.ts. Keep this file free of secrets; the .env
# file itself is gitignored and never committed.

# Moves every command (including MCP tools) to that root.
# WEJOBSEARCHDATAROOT=
